{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。主要遗漏了强撑着提醒自己不能倒下、内心其实想停下来的挣扎，以及期待究竟指向什么仍不清楚这一层。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。旧日亲近感、无法重新拥有的失落，以及不愿被悲伤支配的克制都把握正确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。焦躁纠缠、短暂的温柔松弛，以及亲近感反而凸显今昔距离的转折均理解正确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。温暖感激与不可复得的痛苦、反复思虑和疲惫之间的关系都拼对了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把失落说成此前被克制压住、如今才显露出来。原稿明确说的是原先的支撑感减弱，使失落变得空荡而无遮掩，并没有明确交代失落此前是被克制压抑的。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把暂时放松、不再强求过去回来概括成了释然，略微过度解释。原稿仍保留对远方的祈求、眷恋以及不知道能否得到回应的不确定感，并非已经彻底放下。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。突如其来的惊惧、紧张持续翻涌、熟悉感不完整，以及今昔距离再次凸显的关系都理解正确，也没有臆造惊惧的具体原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。旧日亲近感短暂回来、尚未安顿便淡去、无法真正带来安定的过程完全吻合。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。注意力回到眼下，但此前积累的沉重困惑和疲惫重新浮现，这一转折拼对了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。熟悉感碎片化、无法拼成完整回忆、反复牵动之后陷入迟疑和疲惫，均准确对应原稿。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。压力反复袭来、恐惧仍在，却逐渐产生继续向前的力量，理解准确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。暂时从过去抽离、回到当下，并在保留脆弱和眷恋的同时获得面对现实的主动选择权，均拼对了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。温柔珍惜带来自我肯定，情绪明亮地释放后又收敛，最终留下清晰却近乎孤独的熟悉感和未解疑问，理解准确。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事与完整稿是同一件事：从反复回望旧日归属、经历眷恋与挣扎，到逐渐不再强求过去重现，重新获得面对当下的力量，同时保留未解的疑问、珍惜与孤独；只是个别屏幕对情绪的释然程度略有夸大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c81aebeb-f81e-47bc-995e-e5568c017d76", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T145548293610Z", "elapsed_seconds": 114.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T14:57:42.462256+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2169db90e753bef07bd066e9b2ff6647fbb9c06d1db03f54f95bd53880975872", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T145548293610Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "aea276e193d05e9440cc57ae36eb7704c765272325e3b3f128448bad2bd86fac"}}}
